// Plugin: no-static-staletime — `staleTime: 'static'` is BANNED repo-wide. 'static' silently
// ignores `invalidateQueries()` (documented — UI-Lib-TanStack-Query.md §F-2), which would neuter
// the entire SSE-bus→invalidation seam: the screen would simply never update again, with a green
// check. Every orbweaver key is bus-backed (or harmlessly Infinity), so there is NO legal 'static'
// site — a total ban beats a scoped one (gate `no-static-staletime-on-bus-keys`, strengthened).
// Want "never refetch"? That IS `staleTime: Infinity` — invalidation still works there.
language js

`staleTime: "static"` as $node where {
  $filename <: not r".*\.test\.tsx?$",
  register_diagnostic(span=$node, message="staleTime:'static' silently ignores invalidateQueries — it would disable the SSE bus→cache seam with a green check. Use Infinity (invalidation still overrides it). See UI-Lib-TanStack-Query.md §F-2 / UI-Architecture-and-Layout.md §6.1.")
}
